Cell["\<\
The coordinates of the rays: each axis is read twice, as its positive and its \
negative part, and a vertex keeps its own position on each.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"edf2290c-aa93-454c-a37b-3b4f7f1fd219"],

