 "On the 4-cycle the walk through the vertex 1 is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35aeac7f-0874-4afb-a4c7-e81a9bf7be5a"],
 ", and the antipode 3 is at the same distance from 2 and from 4. ",
