  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f65350b2-ff70-4650-9e84-b00bac592fef"],
 " puts it at 0, with the centre, as does ",
 Cell[BoxData["Mean"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e67fdfc8-ade9-4d49-978c-922944877234"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData["Min"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fa294158-edad-4214-9f37-a1975cb8de6b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["Max"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f9887b3-8d1d-4086-874e-6bc1ec89c186"],
 " put it at an end; ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cf7b464-f106-4243-b56c-6ab9542f9852"],
 " shows the tie. A rule symmetric under reversing the walk identifies the \
antipode with the centre: the tie is a property of the cycle, not of the rule."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"6d0ea360-dbe2-4616-bc39-167391f7bb0a"],

